      "cooked": "<p>Hi <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/akshay2\">@akshay2</a></p>\n<p>The fee schedule is depending upon fee structure and have one to one relationship with it.</p>\n<p>Further Fee structures are required to be defined for Program and controlling student groups within academic year Meaning you must have student group ready under program with defined fee structure as well so that you can schedule fees subsequently.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://docs.frappe.io/education/fee-schedule\" class=\"inline-onebox\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Fee Schedule</a> This may help as well.</p>",
